src/main.inset:15:29-15:36
`#[serde(default)]` is not supported here
Inset takes serde's `rename_all` on a struct or enum, and `rename` on a field or variant
help: write `rename = "..."`, or remove this

src/main.inset:21:22-21:29
serde has no rule `snake`
not a `rename_all` rule
help: the rules are `lowercase`, `UPPERCASE`, `PascalCase`, `camelCase`, `snake_case`, `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE`, `kebab-case` and `SCREAMING-KEBAB-CASE`
